#: games/relic-rush/lua/journey.lua
msgid "Bakers share the temple ovens on feast days. Children waiting for the first loaves fetch water from the quay."
msgstr "祝祭の日には、パン職人たちが神殿の窯を分け合います。最初のパンを待つ子どもたちは、岸壁へ水をくみに行きます。"

#: games/relic-rush/lua/journey.lua
msgid "Give me a real harbour, builder, and I'll send for the families."
msgstr "ちゃんとした港をつくってくれ、棟梁。そうしたら家族を呼びに行く。"

#: games/relic-rush/lua/journey.lua
msgid "Neighbours bring their witnesses to the temple steps. Both sides can hear the terms before they press a seal into the clay."
msgstr "隣人どうしは、証人を連れて神殿の階段へ来ます。双方が取り決めを聞いたうえで、粘土に印を押します。"

#: games/relic-rush/lua/journey.lua
msgid "Somebody built harbour steps here long before us. Where did they all go?"
msgstr "ずっと昔に、誰かがここに港の階段をつくってる。その人たちは、どこへ行ったんだろう。"

#: games/relic-rush/lua/journey.lua
msgid "The crews keep their register by the sun court. A porter looking for a berth can find the boat and its sailing day in the same place."
msgstr "船団の名簿は、太陽の中庭のそばに置かれています。荷運びは、乗る舟と出航の日を、同じ場所で調べられます。"

#: games/relic-rush/lua/journey.lua
msgid "The families are home. Come and see the new fountain."
msgstr "家族が帰ってきたよ。新しい噴水を見においで。"

#: games/relic-rush/lua/journey.lua
msgid "The keeper gives harbour plans a shelf of their own. A mason can lay a drawing flat here and take the measurements down to the quay."
msgstr "番人は、港の設計図に専用の棚を用意します。石工はここで図面を広げ、寸法を岸壁まで持っていけます。"

#: games/relic-rush/lua/journey.lua
msgid "The ship's at sea. My birds are watching for her sails."
msgstr "船は海の上だ。うちの鳥たちが帆を見張ってるよ。"

#: games/relic-rush/lua/journey.lua
msgid "There's a spring up in the rocks. Let's start with a well."
msgstr "岩場の上に泉があるよ。まず井戸から始めよう。"

#: games/relic-rush/lua/journey.lua
msgid "We came ashore with nothing, builder. Build us a town and I'll send the ship for the families."
msgstr "私たちは身ひとつで上陸した、棟梁。町をつくってくれたら、家族を迎えに船を出す。"

#: games/relic-rush/lua/journey.lua
msgid "We keep finding old stones with the same word carved on them."
msgstr "同じ言葉が刻まれた古い石が、次々に見つかるんだ。"

